% TOPQ-2016-14 fig_01b: tZq production (4FS), Z radiated from the top quark
layout: v2
in: i1 i2
out: f1 f2 f3 f4
i1 [u] -- [fermion, color=blue] v1 [dot, color=red] -- [fermion, color=red] f1 [d]
